BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Register Voters in Yolo County
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260501T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260501T183000
UID:1ed84e4321a29620a5bb536ba191764f@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/DemandDemocracyPhoto_Copy%20of%20IMG_7524_2026042617370863646
 4.jpeg
DESCRIPTION:Join Indivisible Yolo in registering voters for the 2026 elect
 ions! Democracy functions best when people engage in conversations about w
 hat needs to be done. When we register voters\, we don't start by pushing 
 a form. Using the Field Team 6 model\, we ask questions and talk about pro
 blems that need to be addressed. We talk about how voting can be a way to 
 get decision makers who will address those problems. Then we make sure the
 y have everything they need to vote on June 2 and November 4. You can 
LOCATION:Davis Central Park\, 401 C St\, Davis\, CA\, 95616
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisibleyolo/event/945820/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Yolo (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
